    "peer_reviewed": "preprint",
    "problems": "The authors note a single main dataset, limited foundation-model coverage, no systematic pathologist evaluation, and correlational analysis. For the claim at issue, no cross-width feature correspondence or split measurement is reported.",
    "rows_left_out": "No other claim-related rows. Results about reconstruction stability, downstream classification, UNI2-h robustness, and comparisons with raw dimensions, PCA and random directions do not test the stated feature-splitting versions.",
